<title>FRANCE: French Mirage fighter crashes, crew safe.</title>
<headline>French Mirage fighter crashes, crew safe.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A French Mirage 2000-D fighter-bomber crashed on Thursday as it was about to land at an airbase near the eastern town of Nancy, the air force said.</p>
<p>The two crew ejected safely before the plane crashed in a wood. An investigation was under way to establish the cause of the accident.</p>
